{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 14 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">2D→3D 与神经场：表示能力、投影一致性和不可辨识性</span><span class=\"lang-en\">2D-to-3D &amp; Neural Fields</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_129_instant_ngp-title\">Instant-NGP</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">Instant-NGP 的速度来自可学习多分辨率 hash-grid encoding 和空空间跳跃，而不是更深的 NeRF MLP。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Replaces fixed sinusoidal positional encodings with a multi-resolution hierarchy of learnable hash tables paired with a tiny fused-CUDA MLP, accelerating neural fields by 100×–1000×.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">3D 坐标、观察方向及训练相机射线</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Continuous 3D coordinate x ∈ R³ mapped across L resolution grids via spatial hashing</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">快速优化的 density/color 场与实时新视角渲染</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Concatenated L×F interpolated feature vector decoded in microseconds into density/attenuation/SDF</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 3 · PDF p.4</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://nvlabs.github.io/instant-ngp/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_129_instant_ngp')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_129_instant_ngp')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"Instant-NGP original paper architecture figure, Figure 3\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/d5a6e3b635641744a95e.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 3 · PDF p.4</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_129_instant_ngp', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_129_instant_ngp\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_129_instant_ngp')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_129_instant_ngp', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_129_instant_ngp\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">坐标 x 与方向 d</span><span class=\"lang-en\">x d</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">沿相机射线采样的连续位置和视角</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests continuous 3d coordinate x ∈ r³ mapped across l resolution grids via spatial hashing and prepares initial tensor representations (x d).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"沿相机射线采样的连续位置和视角\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests continuous 3d coordinate x ∈ r³ mapped across l resolution grids via spatial hashing and prepares initial tensor representations (x d).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"坐标 x 与方向 d\" data-node-name-en=\"x d\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_129_instant_ngp', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">坐标 x 与方向 d</span><span class=\"lang-en\">x d</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">沿相机射线采样的连续位置和视角</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests continuous 3d coordinate x ∈ r³ mapped across l resolution grids via spatial hashing and prepares initial tensor representations (x d).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"从粗到细设置指数增长的 3D 网格分辨率\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes mesh levels to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"多分辨率网格 levels\" data-node-name-en=\"mesh levels\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_129_instant_ngp', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">多分辨率网格 levels</span><span class=\"lang-en\">mesh levels</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">从粗到细设置指数增长的 3D 网格分辨率</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes mesh levels to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"每层网格顶点经空间哈希映射到有限特征表，允许碰撞\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs hash tables within the core multiresolution hash grid neural field computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"可学习 hash tables\" data-node-name-en=\"hash tables\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_129_instant_ngp', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">可学习 hash tables</span><span class=\"lang-en\">hash tables</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">每层网格顶点经空间哈希映射到有限特征表，允许碰撞</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs hash tables within the core multiresolution hash grid neural field computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"查询邻近哈希特征并跨层拼成位置编码\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs concatenation within the core multiresolution hash grid neural field computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"三线性插值与拼接\" data-node-name-en=\"concatenation\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_129_instant_ngp', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">三线性插值与拼接</span><span class=\"lang-en\">concatenation</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">查询邻近哈希特征并跨层拼成位置编码</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs concatenation within the core multiresolution hash grid neural field computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"预测 σ 和几何 latent，不需大 Fourier-feature MLP\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs density MLP within the core multiresolution hash grid neural field computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"小型 density MLP\" data-node-name-en=\"density MLP\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_129_instant_ngp', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">小型 density MLP</span><span class=\"lang-en\">density MLP</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">预测 σ 和几何 latent，不需大 Fourier-feature MLP</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs density MLP within the core multiresolution hash grid neural field computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"用几何 latent 与方向编码预测 RGB\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs color MLP within the core multiresolution hash grid neural field computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"方向条件 color MLP\" data-node-name-en=\"color MLP\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_129_instant_ngp', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">方向条件 color MLP</span><span class=\"lang-en\">color MLP</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">用几何 latent 与方向编码预测 RGB</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs color MLP within the core multiresolution hash grid neural field computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"跳过空空间并动态集中采样到占据区域\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Occupancy grid/ray marching to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"Occupancy grid/ray marching\" data-node-name-en=\"Occupancy grid/ray marching\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_129_instant_ngp', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Occupancy grid/ray marching</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">跳过空空间并动态集中采样到占据区域</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Occupancy grid/ray marching to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"沿射线累积颜色与透明度，反向更新哈希表和 MLP\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces concatenated l×f interpolated feature vector decoded in microseconds into density/attenuation/sdf via Volume rendering.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"Volume rendering\" data-node-name-en=\"Volume rendering\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_129_instant_ngp', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Volume rendering</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">沿射线累积颜色与透明度，反向更新哈希表和 MLP</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces concatenated l×f interpolated feature vector decoded in microseconds into density/attenuation/sdf via Volume rendering.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"Instant-NGP Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 多分辨率哈希网格插值与轻量神经场查询</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Multi-Resolution Spatial Hash-Grid Trilinear Interpolation &amp; Tiny MLP Readout</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Instant-NGP：核心公式 · 多分辨率哈希网格插值与轻量神经场查询\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"129\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"23.540528pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.831587 -69.011212 290.815862 23.540528\" width=\"290.815862pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M4.744351-1.042169L4.61532-1.161274C4.079348-.486346 3.960242-.377166 3.801436-.377166C3.712107-.377166 3.642629-.456569 3.642629-.5558