se><use x=\"98.242096\" xlink:href=\"#m129_g10-186\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"104.825105\" xlink:href=\"#m129_g1-61\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"115.66217\" xlink:href=\"#m129_g16-53\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"119.222323\" xlink:href=\"#m129_g13-92\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"124.498584\" xlink:href=\"#m129_g10-185\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"128.812407\" xlink:href=\"#m129_g10-187\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"132.687855\" xlink:href=\"#m129_g16-29\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"139.980511\" xlink:href=\"#m129_g20-49\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"144.613134\" xlink:href=\"#m129_g10-185\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"148.329195\" xlink:href=\"#m129_g16-71\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"153.235777\" xlink:href=\"#m129_g10-186\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"157.051453\" xlink:href=\"#m129_g16-150\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"161.471487\" xlink:href=\"#m129_g16-149\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"165.951314\" xlink:href=\"#m129_g16-149\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"170.43114\" xlink:href=\"#m129_g16-149\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"174.751527\" xlink:href=\"#m129_g16-150\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"179.27119\" xlink:href=\"#m129_g16-29\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"186.927484\" xlink:href=\"#m129_g13-33\" y=\"-57.322577\"></use><use x=\"192.792824\" xlink:href=\"#m129_g10-185\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"196.508884\" xlink:href=\"#m129_g16-71\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"201.415466\" xlink:href=\"#m129_g10-186\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"205.231142\" xlink:href=\"#m129_g10-188\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"209.146456\" xlink:href=\"#m129_g16-150\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"213.656153\" xlink:href=\"#m129_g16-51\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use><use x=\"219.15553\" xlink:href=\"#m129_g10-186\" y=\"-58.816958\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">坐标 MLP 的 Fourier features 训练慢，细节与速度难兼顾</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Deep coordinate MLPs (8 layers × 256 channels) were computationally expensive to evaluate millions of times per optimization step.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">用多分辨率哈希网格编码坐标并以小 MLP 表示场景</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Store trainable feature vectors directly in compact multi-resolution hash tables indexed by voxel corners, letting a tiny 2-layer MLP resolve hash collisions.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">可学习哈希表在不同尺度存储局部特征，使 NeRF 训练缩短到秒/分钟级</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">O(1) multi-scale hash lookup + implicit gradient-based collision resolution + occupancy grid empty-space skipping.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">加速 CBCT attenuation fields、医学 INR 和配准场优化</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Core acceleration engine inside NAF (CBCT), implicit deformable registration, and real-time surgical scene neural fields.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">高效坐标编码基础；哈希碰撞和显存参数需按医学分辨率调节</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Essential coordinate-encoding infrastructure; high-frequency hash levels can fit measurement noise if not regularized.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">多个空间尺度的可学习哈希表同时存储粗结构和细节。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">哈希编码把表示容量放在局部特征表中，因此后端 MLP 可以很小。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">occupancy skipping 与 GPU 融合内核显著缩短训练和渲染。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Store trainable feature vectors directly in compact multi-resolution hash tables indexed by voxel corners, letting a tiny 2-layer MLP resolve hash collisions.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: O(1) multi-scale hash lookup + implicit gradient-based collision resolution + occupancy grid empty-space skipping.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Multi-Resolution Spatial Hash-Grid Trilinear Interpolation &amp; Tiny MLP Readout.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">可加速 CBCT attenuation field、医学 INR、配准场或内镜场景优化。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">哈希碰撞和快速拟合可能隐藏局部伪影；定量衰减场需与投影残差和物理单位共同验证。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Core acceleration engine inside NAF (CBCT), implicit deformable registration, and real-time surgical scene neural fields.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Essential coordinate-encoding infrastructure; high-frequency hash levels can fit measurement noise if not regularized.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://nvlabs.github.io/instant-ngp/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Instant Neural Graphics Primitives with a Multiresolution Hash Encoding</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/NVlabs/instant-ngp\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
